 style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Familiarity with the Delmarva Peninsula and TidalHealth service area preferred.</span></span></li></ul><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><span style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Schedule:</span></b></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Primarily day shift.</span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></li><li class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Hours based on departmental needs.</span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Thanks,</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Erin Cowder, SHRM-CP</span></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Compensation Analyst</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Human Resources Department</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Tidal Health</span></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><b>tidalhealth.org</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Have a question for HR?&nbsp; Send it to our Shared Services team.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"></span><a href=\"https://apps.powerapps.com/play/e/default-ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8/a/7f4b8c55-c804-4afa-